# Test wallet for the x402 experiment — Base Sepolia testnet only.
#
# Copy this file to step1-node/.env (next to pay.js) and fill in PRIVATE_KEY.
# Do not commit your filled-in .env. The repo .gitignore covers it.
#
# Rules for this key:
#   - 64 hex chars, with or without 0x prefix
#   - Generate fresh, never reuse one that has ever held real funds
#   - One-liner to generate (run from step1-node/ after `npm install`):
#       node -e "import('viem/accounts').then(m => { const pk = m.generatePrivateKey(); const acc = m.privateKeyToAccount(pk); console.log('address:', acc.address); console.log('private key:', pk); })"
#   - Fund the printed address with Base Sepolia USDC: https://faucet.circle.com
#   - Throw the key away when the experiment ends

PRIVATE_KEY=0xReplaceWith64HexCharsNeverCommitThisFile
